hy-memory-mcp
An independently maintained Windows MCP service built on Hy-Memory.
This project is not an official Tencent product.

Hy-Memory upstream: https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory
Source SDK version: hy-memory 2.0.3
Copyright (C) 2026 Tencent. All rights reserved.
Upstream license: Apache-2.0; see third_party/HY-MEMORY-LICENSE.

apply_patches.py contains upstream source fragments. patches/*.diff contains
upstream source context and modifications to agent/extractor.py,
agent/reconciler.py, pipelines/writer.py and pipelines/_retrieval/dedup.py.
Local modifications add response/schema validation, token budget adjustments,
confirmed-write accounting, and deduplication consistency checks. The diff
files identify changed lines; apply_patches.py documents the modifications.
